### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### FLUJO USER NORMAL — happy path
###
### Un user con rol USER (sin privilegios admin):
###   - Solo ve sus propios containers.
###   - Puede crear containers nuevos.
###   - Puede gestionar (start/stop/...) los suyos.
###   - NO puede listar usuarios.
###   - NO puede tocar containers de otros users.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiV1 = {{host}}/api/v1


### Register user normal (solo la primera vez)
POST {{apiV1}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "TestingFlow",
  "email": "testingflow@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Login → guarda el token
POST {{apiV1}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "userb@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}


### Ver mi perfil
GET {{apiV1}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Listar mis containers (al principio: vacío)
GET {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Crear mi propio container → guarda el id
POST {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "nginx:alpine",
  "name": "user-demo",
  "autoStart": true
}

> {%
client.global.set("containerId", response.body.id);
%}


### Listar otra vez (ahora aparece el mío)
GET {{apiV1}}/containers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Inspect del mío
GET {{apiV1}}/containers/e14101366d80979d82d644dd0275ee7bc39b572e2f0611a20a09781a71615240
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Logs del mío
GET {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/logs?tail=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Stop el mío
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/e14101366d80979d82d644dd0275ee7bc39b572e2f0611a20a09781a71615240/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Start el mío
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/e14101366d80979d82d644dd0275ee7bc39b572e2f0611a20a09781a71615240/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Restart el mío
POST {{apiV1}}/containers/{{containerId}}/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Borrar el mío
DELETE {{apiV1}}/containers/e14101366d80979d82d644dd0275ee7bc39b572e2f0611a20a09781a71615240
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
